              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AL Rip"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Ten kinds of Yummy!! Soak for a day, crock pot for a day, eat for two days!! So easy!!",
            "datePublished": "2011-10-24T06:24:31.923Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "C Abbey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mother used to make this years ago and I acquired a taste for it. Easily bland for some people, though. However, I doubled everything except the beans and it turned out rather tasty. Our house loved it and ate every bit of it. Only thing though, some people may want to adjust how salty it is by adding their own salt later when it's served. Otherwise, it's delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2007-01-10T14:36:21.030Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
