            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Knmitche"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was a great framework for the beans. I added a can of collard greens, a small can of diced tomatoes, and some leftover chicken shredded. This turned out to be a great dish for a snow day in!",
            "datePublished": "2013-01-25T20:58:53.273Z"
